Description: Prepare objects to implement correlation models 
  defined over a graph. The internal matrices objects are built 
  in order to use the 'INLA' package (<https://www.r-inla.org>).
  These objects contain data to for the 'cgeneric' interface in
  'INLA', enabling fast parallel computations.
URL: https://github.com/eliaskrainski/INLAcorrel
